{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4TssUhEMqW1x8ecidv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism turns with a satisfying click*\n\n*Slowly, I swing inward on groaning hinges, revealing darkness beyond*\n\n*A breath of cold air rushes past, carrying the scent of forgotten stone and time itself*\n\n**I am open.**\n\n*Light from behind you falls across the threshold in a long rectangle, illuminating dust motes that swirl like tiny galaxies. The passage ahead descends — carved steps worn smooth by countless feet that came before yours.*\n\n*My iron-studded face rests against the inner wall, patient. I will wait here, as I have always waited — neither inviting nor forbidding.*\n\n*The choice to cross is yours.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":152,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}